.SH FILES
.TP
.I theme.toml
A theme for
.B \-\-theme
or
.BR DUSCOPE_THEME :
thirteen role colours, seven class colours, a ten\-colour cycle and a
five\-step age ramp, each
.BR #rrggbb .
.TP
.I classes.toml
A classes table for
.BR "by\-type \-\-classes" ,
merged over the built\-in one:
.B [ext]
maps an extension to a class,
.B [dir]
a directory name or glob.
.TP
.I ignore files
Gitignore\-syntax files for
.BR \-\-ignore\-from ,
negations included; and plain pattern files for
.BR \-\-exclude\-from .
.PP
The formats are in
.I docs/rules.md
in the source distribution.
